        <span style="font-size:14px">📝</span> Abalone Online Blog
        <span style="font-size:9px;padding:2px 5px;background:rgba(200,168,75,0.15);color:var(--gold);border-radius:3px;margin-left:2px">OFFICIEL</span>
      </a>
